   are not declared on this satellite in data_7.js. Do not treat it as part of the
   ratified vault. ***
   anchor      : HUB_CLAIM   (kind: hub, origin: map.anchor)
   track       : unratified
   history     : (not declared in data_7.js)
   feeders     : 1 emitted of 1 (one per source view AND run)
   runs        : 1 -- opus_health_v2
   payload     : 10 attribute(s), NULL-PADDED TO THE SATELLITE
   grain       : ONE ROW PER HUB_CLAIM_HK
   hashdiff    : SAT_CLAIM_TRANSPORT_LEG_HASHDIFF (builder decision BD1), GUARDED against an all-null input (s5.5):
                 without the guard every all-null row hashes to ONE value and the
